						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														My reason was probly selfish, but was not in a good mood in RL (sick).  I got my officer quest and i was very excited, i camped Webby with a friend and he went down, camped the stupid goblin in Everfrost to get the ice staff, then i had a 52 friend of mine help me do the rest which was get some staff from Slo A, and get 1 from beholders maze we waited for hours with no luck on eather spawn. I was gonna make up for the loss of the 2 staffs by givening a VERY nice tunic tward my quest. I waited all day for 7 pm est time when Ukari said he would be on, was on all day due to the fact i was sick, waited and waited and waited till about 12 midnight and Ukari never showed. The next day i got on RIGHT after school and waited till about 11 pm and wasnt very happy that i used my time on the week end only to be set up for disapointment so drac told me about his new guild earlyer in the night and got me all set up for joining so i did, That is my selfish reason for leaving. Would love to come back to the guild and hand in those quest items, but probly dont deserve to, Cya eveyone thanks for the fun times. hope you will take me back because we all make mistakes!						</td>
